# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-08-06 18:52

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:380
translate english 45e3cbfd:

    # think "J'ouvre les yeux sans avoir l'impression d'avoir vraiment dormi. Rien qui ne change des jours précédents au final."
    think "I open my eyes without feeling like I ever really slept. No different from the past few days, in the end."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:381
translate english 96c12e81:

    # think "La nuque raide, les épaules dures. Mon corps s'est couché ; ma tête, non."
    think "Stiff neck, tense shoulders. My body went to bed; my mind didn't."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:385
translate english 8b3957b9:

    # think "Il y a deux jours, on a échoué. Demain, on échouera aussi."
    think "We failed two days ago. Tomorrow, we'll fail again."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:389
translate english 6cb5c04e:

    # think "Ça ne passera pas. Personne n'y croit plus. Sael a déjà annoncé qu'elle votera contre..."
    think "It won't pass. No one believes it will anymore. Sael already said she'd vote against it..."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:393
translate english 1eb3534d:

    # think "Je pourrais aller à la cafétéria, mais à quoi ça servirait ?"
    think "I could go to the cafeteria, but what would be the point?"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:394
translate english 7c4b07ec:

    # think "J'y retrouverai les mêmes silences. Les mêmes regards qui fuient. Et la même certitude dans chaque tête : ce vote va échouer."
    think "I'd find the same silences. The same averted eyes. And the same certainty in everyone's mind: this vote is going to fail."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:396
translate english b21e91fb:

    # noam "Pfff, à quoi ça servirait ?."
    noam "Ugh, what's the point?"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:400
translate english e5d8efb8:

    # think "Le vote n'a aucune chance de passer."
    think "The vote doesn't stand a chance."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:401
translate english a8a8e230:

    # think "L'ambiance est glaciale. Sael était fermée à la discussion."
    think "The atmosphere is ice-cold. Sael wouldn't even discuss it."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:402
translate english 0a0f0487:

    # think "Julian se mure dans sa chambre."
    think "Julian has shut himself away in his room."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:403
translate english e6d281c4:

    # think "Et moi, je n'ai même pas de bonne réponse. Je ne suis même pas sûr de voter pour. Mais je n'abandonnerai pas."
    think "And I don't even have a good answer myself. I'm not even sure I'll vote for it. But I'm not giving up."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:405
translate english add02ced:

    # think "Le pire, c'est que chacun a une part de raison. Et demain, il faudra trancher comme si une décision acceptable existait."
    think "The worst part is, everyone is partly right. And tomorrow, we'll have to choose as though there were an acceptable decision to make."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:406
translate english 34c6c893:

    # think "Face, tu gagnes. Pile, je perds."
    think "Heads, you win. Tails, I lose."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:415
translate english a363ac34:

    # kami "Bonjour à tous, oh vous me semblez particulièrement éteint ce matin."
    kami "Good morning, everyone! Oh, you look especially lifeless today."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:416
translate english c93da9bc:

    # kami "Un simple petit échec, et vous voilà dans cet état ?!"
    kami "One tiny little failure, and this is what you turn into?!"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:417
translate english 005452f0:

    # kami "Ne vous inquiétez pas : votre prochaine chance de tout rater arrive dans vingt-quatre heures !"
    kami "Don't worry: your next chance to mess everything up is only twenty-four hours away!"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:420
translate english 49d5842b:

    # kami "La cafétéria est ouverte. Vos rations sont prêtes. Ce sont les mêmes qu'hier."
    kami "The cafeteria is open. Your rations are ready. They're the same as yesterday's."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:421
translate english 2eac1109:

    # kami "Vous recevrez de nouvelles portions lors de la matinée du jour 7. En attendant, à la DIET ! Comme tout le monde !"
    kami "You'll receive fresh portions on the morning of Day 7. Until then, you're all on a DIET! Just like everyone else!"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:422
translate english 294ffbd7:

    # kami "Et comme toujours, j'observerai avec beaucoup d'intérêt ce que vous allez faire de cette belle matinée ensoleillée."
    kami "And as always, I'll be watching with great interest to see what you do with this lovely sunny morning."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:425
translate english ca8ba279:

    # kami "Oups, j'oubliais : vous ne pouvez pas voir le soleil depuis le Conclave !"
    kami "Oops, I forgot: you can't see the sun from inside the Conclave!"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:431
translate english 8eb7bbcf:

    # think "L'écran s'éteint sur son rire."
    think "The screen goes dark to the sound of her laughter."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:432
translate english 52d46b23:

    # think "La cafétéria. C'est vraiment le point de rendez-vous matinal."
    think "The cafeteria. It really is our morning meeting spot."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:433
translate english 0dba8ffd:

    # think "J'imagine l'ambiance. Est-ce que j'ai vraiment envie de traverser ça ce matin ?"
    think "I can already picture the mood. Do I really want to put myself through that this morning?"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:435
translate english 2f0620d4:

    # think "Le pain sur ma table est dur, sec et silencieux. Il fera bien l'affaire."
    think "The bread on my table is hard, dry, and quiet. It'll do."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:439
translate english 2501288f:

    # think "Je prends le pain. Il est vraiment sec. La nourriture typique qu'on devait avaler chaque jour depuis un an."
    think "I pick up the bread. It really is dry. The kind of food we've had to choke down every day for the past year."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:440
translate english 52287fa2:

    # think "Je me demande si quelqu'un remarquera que je ne suis pas venu à la cafétéria."
    think "I wonder if anyone will notice I didn't come to the cafeteria."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:441
translate english b49a3c6e:

    # think "Je mords dedans. Ça craque sous les dents. Le goût précis de presque rien, si ce n'est de la farine."
    think "I bite into it. It cracks between my teeth. It tastes of almost nothing, except flour."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:443
translate english beea7009:

    # think "Je termine le morceau et m'essuie la main. Petit-déjeuner réussi, selon des critères très bas."
    think "I finish it and wipe my hand. A successful breakfast, by very low standards."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:445
translate english 80e2e77a:

    # "Des pas et des voix traversent le couloir. Des groupes semblent s'éloigner et remonter dans le Conclave."
    "Footsteps and voices drift through the hallway. Groups seem to be splitting up and heading deeper into the Conclave."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:446
translate english ea6f705e:

    # think "Je ne peux pas les rejoindre. Pas avant de savoir ce que je peux encore faire."
    think "I can't join them. Not until I know what I can still do."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:448
translate english b2c29c57:

    # think "Sael. Si elle vote contre, c'est foutu quoi qu'il arrive. Il faut que je lui parle."
    think "Sael. If she votes against it, it's over no matter what. I need to talk to her."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:449
translate english 48d935cb:

    # think "Avant que ce soit trop tard. Je pense qu'elle essaye de rester seule, elle aussi."
    think "Before it's too late. I think she's trying to be alone too."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:463
translate english c6e0b72f:

    # think "Voyons voir, où se trouve la chambre de Sael ? Ah, ici. La porte avec le tissu noir sur la poignée. Signe ou habitude, je n'en sais rien."
    think "Let's see, where's Sael's room? Ah, here. The door with the black cloth tied around the handle. A sign or a habit, I have no idea."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:464
translate english 494bba02_1:

    # "Je m'arrête devant sa porte."
    "I stop outside her door."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:465
translate english f221461c:

    # think "A-t-elle envie de me parler ? Est-ce que quelqu'un en a envie ce matin ?"
    think "Does she even want to talk to me? Does anyone this morning?"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:466
translate english 802bc648:

    # "Je frappe deux coups."
    "I knock twice."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:471
translate english c09788b4_2:

    # "Rien."
    "Nothing."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:472
translate english bfb28fd4:

    # "Je frappe encore, plus fort."
    "I knock again, louder this time."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:477
translate english 44c58c17:

    # "Un froissement, puis la porte s'entrouvre."
    "A rustle, then the door opens a crack."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:483
translate english 5b691692:

    # sael "..."
    sael "..."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:484
translate english 39b789e0:

    # sael mefiant "Noam. C'est toi, évidemment."
    sael mefiant "Noam. Of course it's you."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:486
translate english 2995d541:

    # noam triste "Tu n'as pas mangé depuis quand ? Enfin… ce n'est pas pour ça que je suis là."
    noam triste "When was the last time you ate? I mean... that's not why I'm here."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:488
translate english 8822d493:

    # sael triste "... Qu'est-ce que tu viens chercher, Noam ?"
    sael triste "...What did you come looking for, Noam?"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:490
translate english d3ebd734:

    # noam hesitation "Je pense qu'on devrait parler du vote. De demain."
    noam hesitation "I think we should talk about the vote. About tomorrow."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:491
translate english 5e4f8c97:

    # noam reflechit "Mais tu t'en doutais déjà, hein ?"
    noam reflechit "But you already guessed that, didn't you?"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:493
translate english 0e75a4f4:

    # "Elle s'écarte juste assez pour m'inviter à entrer dans sa chambre."
    "She steps aside just far enough to invite me into her room."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:495
translate english 6ee3438e:

    # sael sourire "Entre. Les seuils de porte ne sont pas faits pour les longues conversations."
    sael sourire "Come in. Doorways aren't made for long conversations."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:499
translate english 6750a33a:

    # think "Le lit a été démonté. Planches au sol, une couette, puis du vide."
    think "The bed has been taken apart. Planks on the floor, a comforter, then empty space."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:500
translate english c441107d:

    # think "Aux murs : ficelles, os, bois tressé. Des signes dans une langue que je ne sais pas lire."
    think "On the walls: string, bones, woven wood. Symbols in a language I can't read."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:501
translate english b1deefd1:

    # think "Ça ne ressemble pas du tout à une chambre. Et je ne sais pas pourquoi, étrangement, ça ne me surprend pas tant que ça."
    think "It doesn't look like a room at all. And for some reason, strangely, that doesn't surprise me much."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:503
translate english 6fc92d3b:

    # sael reflechit "Désolée, c'est assez... Rustique. Je préfère comme ça."
    sael reflechit "Sorry. It's rather... rustic. I prefer it this way."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:510
translate english 66ce7fb8:

    # noam surpris "Tu as vraiment tout enlevé…"
    noam surpris "You really took everything apart..."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:512
translate english 37b9e23d:

    # sael reflechit "Ce qui ne sert pas prend de la place. Ces planches, elles peuvent peut-être me servir plus tard."
    sael reflechit "Anything useless only takes up space. These planks may come in handy later."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:514
translate english 5d7d8df5:

    # noam reflechit "Et tout ça… les os, les fils…"
    noam reflechit "And all this... the bones, the strings..."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:516
translate english 37cd5902:

    # think "Elle me regarde enfin. Ni vexée ni gênée."
    think "She finally looks at me. Neither offended nor embarrassed."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:518
translate english dc118059:

    # sael sourire "Dis ce que tu es venu dire. Le reste ne t'aidera pas."
    sael sourire "Say what you came to say. The rest won't help you."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:519
translate english 40636ad7:

    # sael triste "Je n'attends pas de toi que tu comprennes comment on vit en dehors des grandes villes."
    sael triste "I don't expect you to understand how people live outside the big cities."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:524
translate english 7fedb46b:

    # noam reflexion "Disons que la chambre te représente bien."
    noam reflexion "Let's just say the room suits you."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:526
translate english 9354528f:

    # noam triste "Tu as encore réfléchi aux frontières. Enfin— je ne viens pas te demander de changer de camp."
    noam triste "You've thought more about the borders. I mean—I didn't come here to ask you to switch sides."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:527
translate english 92c8cb59:

    # noam reflexion "Je veux comprendre où tu en es."
    noam reflexion "I want to understand where you stand."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:529
translate english 6e506cdd:

    # sael mefiant "C'est ce que m'a dit Tomas, avant d'essayer de me convaincre."
    sael mefiant "That's what Tomas said before he tried to convince me."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:531
translate english 6a42e881:

    # noam reflechit "Ah, Tomas est venu ?"
    noam reflechit "Oh, Tomas came by?"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:533
translate english a80bcc69:

    # sael triste "Pour toi, ce sera la même chose."
    sael triste "It will be the same with you."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:535
translate english 86fc8f5a:

    # noam triste "Pour tout te dire, je suis perdu aussi. Je ne sais pas quoi voter."
    noam triste "Honestly, I'm lost too. I don't know how I'm going to vote."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:536
translate english fad3a339:

    # noam sourire "Alors ne t'en fais pas, quoi que tu fasses, je ne te jugerai pas."
    noam sourire "So don't worry. Whatever you decide, I won't judge you."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:538
translate english e32b4e6b:

    # think "Elle incline la tête. Vraisemblablement surprise."
    think "She tilts her head. Apparently surprised."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:540
translate english 654ade44:

    # sael reflechit "Peut-être. Mais ça ne change pas ma réponse."
    sael reflechit "Perhaps. But it doesn't change my answer."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:542
translate english 637a85f1:

    # noam reflexion "Je me dis que la libre circulation, ce sont aussi des gens de Limen qui pourraient aller ailleurs."
    noam reflexion "I keep thinking that freedom of movement would also let people from Limen go elsewhere."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:543
translate english 42172a3a:

    # noam "Des familles séparées qui pourraient se retrouver. Enfin… ce n'est pas seulement une porte ouverte au danger."
    noam "Separated families could be reunited. I mean... it isn't only a door opening onto danger."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:545
translate english 249607e8:

    # sael desaccord "On en a déjà discuté. C'est une mauvaise idée pour tout un tas de raison."
    sael desaccord "We've already discussed this. It's a bad idea for all sorts of reasons."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:546
translate english 51477390:

    # sael triste "Être libre d'aller où on veut, d'accord mais pour quoi faire ? Les gens se détestent."
    sael triste "Being free to go wherever you want, fine—but for what? People hate one another."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:547
translate english dd666bdb:

    # sael colere "Et tu ne me feras pas croire un instant que vous les Harmonistes, vous ne détestez pas les Limenois."
    sael colere "And don't expect me to believe for one second that you Harmonists don't hate the Limenians."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:549
translate english 8f38c45e:

    # noam sourire "Moi je ne vous déteste pas."
    noam sourire "I don't hate you."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:551
translate english f50e8a6e:

    # sael colere "H-Hein ? Si Limen est aujourd'hui un tas de cendre c'est à cause de sa cupidité !"
    sael colere "W-What? Limen is a pile of ashes today because of its own greed!"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:552
translate english 15ab912a:

    # sael triste "D'une certaine manière, si Kami existe, c'est peut-être même à cause des guerres Limenoises."
    sael triste "In a way, the Limenian wars may even be the reason Kami exists."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:554
translate english 916726cb:

    # noam triste "Peut-être. Ou peut-être pas."
    noam triste "Maybe. Maybe not."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:555
translate english 61d243c8:

    # noam reflechit "Arrêter les guerres et la violence n'était sans doute qu'un prétexte parfait pour que Kami prenne les pleins pouvoirs sans grande résistance."
    noam reflechit "Ending war and violence was probably just the perfect excuse for Kami to seize absolute power without much resistance."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:557
translate english 8201ddfc:

    # sael determine "Les Limenois doivent rester à Limen. Non seulement pour les protéger, mais aussi pour payer le prix du sang qu'on a fait couler."
    sael determine "The Limenians must remain in Limen. Not only for their protection, but also to pay the price for all the blood that was spilled."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:558
translate english 58c20fd6:

    # sael colere "Et je me fiche de savoir si mon peuple est de mon avis. Cette décision est celle de la responsabilité."
    sael colere "And I don't care whether my people agree with me. This is the responsible choice."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:560
translate english 4e2d2709:

    # noam inquiet "Donc tu voteras contre quoi qu'il arrive ?"
    noam inquiet "So you'll vote against it no matter what?"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:562
translate english 633d4890:

    # sael raison "Oui. Et rien ne me fera changer d'avis."
    sael raison "Yes. Nothing will change my mind."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:563
translate english b3f2e6ac:

    # sael determine "Mara votera contre aussi. Nous en avons parlé hier soir."
    sael determine "Mara will vote against it as well. We spoke last night."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:564
translate english c37e8e71:

    # sael fatigue "Tu n'étais pas obligé de venir. Cela n'a rien changer à mon avis."
    sael fatigue "You didn't have to come. It hasn't changed my mind."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:565
translate english bbff1f65:

    # sael fatigue "Mais j'apprécie que tu aies essayé. Nous avons parlé sans ajouter une blessure aux autres."
    sael fatigue "But I appreciate that you tried. We managed to talk without hurting each other any further."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:567
translate english 880a3559:

    # noam raison "Nous sommes des gens civilisés, on est là pour se serrer les coudes."
    noam raison "We're civilized people. We're supposed to stick together."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:572
translate english 05194e70:

    # "Sael me raccompagne et referme sa porte derrière moi."
    "Sael walks me out and closes the door behind me."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:576
translate english 6883500a:

    # think "Sael contre. Mara contre."
    think "Sael against. Mara against."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:577
translate english aa87abf9:

    # think "Le vote n'a donc aucune chance de passer. C'est déjà perdu."
    think "So the vote has no chance of passing. It's already over."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:578
translate english 73e5a43b:

    # think "Je me demande si ce vote a encore un sens."
    think "I wonder whether this vote still means anything."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:579
translate english 439c426d:

    # think "Si quelque chose peut encore être rattrapé."
    think "Whether anything can still be salvaged."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:580
translate english f42f58b4:

    # think "Participer, est-ce cautionner ce système pourri ? Ou seulement le traverser pendant qu'il nous démonte ?"
    think "Does taking part mean endorsing this rotten system? Or just surviving it while it tears us apart?"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:581
translate english 3ac4644b:

    # think "Puis recommencer. Encore. Encore."
    think "Then doing it all over again. Again. Again."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:599
translate english 75d5f8cb:

    # think "Ne sachant pas quoi faire, je marche sans réelle direction. Le Conclave parait désert."
    think "With no idea what to do, I wander without any real direction. The Conclave seems deserted."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:601
translate english d61043e1:

    # "La salle commune est vide : une chaise renversée, un plateau abandonné."
    "The common room is empty: an overturned chair, an abandoned tray."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:603
translate english 5473d724:

    # think "Je devrais faire quelque chose. Mais faire quoi ? Convaincre qui ? De quoi, exactement ?"
    think "I should do something. But what? Convince whom? Of what, exactly?"

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:605
translate english 0e005070:

    # think "Julian. Il doit encore être dans sa chambre."
    think "Julian. He must still be in his room."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:606
translate english 306e3f71:

    # think "Kael a dit qu'il avait tenté d'aller le voir hier soir."
    think "Kael said he tried to see him last night."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:607
translate english fefb76eb:

    # think "Qu'il lui avait répondu de le laisser tranquille."
    think "That Julian told him to leave him alone."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:609
translate english afc55ade:

    # "Je m'arrête."
    "I stop."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:611
translate english 830b14d8:

    # think "Sinon, dans la salle d'observation, sur les ordinateurs, on peut voir l'état des districts."
    think "Or I could check the observation room. The computers there show the state of the districts."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:612
translate english 578c0187:

    # think "Qu'espèrent les gens par rapport au vote de demain ? Je me le demande bien."
    think "What are people hoping for from tomorrow's vote? I can't help wondering."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:634
translate english 1bd81187:

    # think "Bon, Julian m'inquiète à ne plus se montrer du tout, ça ne lui ressemble pas."
    think "Still, Julian worries me. He hasn't shown his face at all, and that's not like him."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:636
translate english 906fa59f:

    # "Je frappe."
    "I knock."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:641
translate english e0450218:

    # think "Rien."
    think "Nothing."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:642
translate english 7c3656c3:

    # "Je frappe encore."
    "I knock again."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:647
translate english e27c9166:

    # think "J'entends un mouvement derrière la porte."
    think "I hear movement behind the door."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:649
translate english 0ff8b0f6:

    # noam "Julian. C'est moi."
    noam "Julian. It's me."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:657
translate english e4478f60:

    # "La porte s'ouvre."
    "The door opens."

# game/scenario/5_0.rpy:659
